  "transformedHtml": "<article class=\"legal-article\" id=\"art-133\">\n    <header class=\"article-header\">\n        <h2 class=\"article-number\">Article 133</h2>\n    </header>\n    <div class=\"article-content\">\n        <div class=\"article-text\">\n            <section class=\"paragraph\">\n                <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 1er.</h3>\n                <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n                    <p>Pour ce qui concerne <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"1\" data-dossier-number=\"2010-12-13/07\" data-law-type=\"L\" data-article-number=\"4\">bpost</span>, l'Institut donne un avis motivé selon les formes et dans les cas prévus en vertu du présent titre.</p>\n                    <p>De sa propre initiative, à la demande du Ministre, [...] ou du <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"2\" data-dossier-number=\"2024-05-12/16\" data-law-type=\"AR\" data-article-number=\"8\">commission consultative spéciale Services postaux et e-commerce</span>, l'Institut donne un avis motivé sur toutes questions relatives aux services postaux [...].</p>\n                    <p><span class=\"legal-citation legal-citation-standard\" data-dossier-number=\"1999-06-09/57\" data-law-type=\"AR\" data-article-number=\"3\">&lt;AR 1999-06-09/57, art. 3, 1°, 2° et 3°, 027;**En vigueur :**18-08-1999&gt;</span></p>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n            <section class=\"paragraph\">\n                <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 2.</h3>\n                <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n                    <p>L'Institut assiste le Ministre dans la négociation du contrat de gestion avec <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"1\" data-dossier-number=\"2010-12-13/07\" data-law-type=\"L\" data-article-number=\"4\">bpost</span>, ainsi que de ses adaptations.</p>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n            <section class=\"paragraph\">\n                <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 3.</h3>\n                <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n                    <p>L'Institut peut, en outre, être chargé des missions suivantes :</p>\n                    <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n                        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\">\n                            <span class=\"provision-text\">réaliser des recherches et des études relatives aux services postaux et aux services financiers postaux;</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\">\n                            <span class=\"provision-text\">[...] <span class=\"legal-citation legal-citation-standard\" data-dossier-number=\"2003-01-17/30\" data-law-type=\"L\" data-article-number=\"41\">&lt;L 2003-01-17/30, art. 41, 043;**En vigueur :**23-04-2003&gt;</span></span>\n                        </li>\n                    </ol>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n            <section class=\"paragraph\">\n                <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 4.</h3>\n                <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n                    <p>(Alinéa 5 abrogé) <span class=\"legal-citation legal-citation-standard\" data-dossier-number=\"2003-01-17/30\" data-law-type=\"L\" data-article-number=\"41\">&lt;L 2003-01-17/30, art. 41, 043;**En vigueur :**23-04-2003&gt;</span></p>\n                    <p>(Alinéa 6 abrogé) <span class=\"legal-citation legal-citation-standard\" data-dossier-number=\"1999-06-09/57\" data-law-type=\"AR\" data-article-number=\"3\">&lt;AR 1999-06-09/57, art. 3, 6°, 027;**En vigueur :**18-08-1999&gt;</span></p>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</article>",
